{"sections":[],"primaryContentSections":[{"declarations":[{"languages":["swift"],"platforms":["Linux"],"tokens":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"func"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"trackLifecycle"},{"kind":"text","text":"("},{"kind":"externalParam","text":"kinds"},{"kind":"text","text":": "},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","text":"Set","preciseIdentifier":"s:Sh"},{"kind":"text","text":"<"},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","identifier":"doc:\/\/LifecycleTracking\/documentation\/LifecycleTracking\/LifecycleObservation","text":"LifecycleObservation","preciseIdentifier":"s:17LifecycleTracking0A11ObservationV"},{"kind":"text","text":"."},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","identifier":"doc:\/\/LifecycleTracking\/documentation\/LifecycleTracking\/LifecycleObservation\/Kind","text":"Kind","preciseIdentifier":"s:17LifecycleTracking0A11ObservationV4KindO"},{"kind":"text","text":"> = Set(LifecycleObservation.Kind.allCases), "},{"kind":"externalParam","text":"version"},{"kind":"text","text":": "},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","text":"String","preciseIdentifier":"s:SS"},{"kind":"text","text":"? = Bundle.main.infoDictionary?[\"CFBundleShortVersionString\"] as? String, "},{"kind":"externalParam","text":"versionStore"},{"kind":"text","text":": "},{"kind":"keyword","text":"some"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","identifier":"doc:\/\/LifecycleTracking\/documentation\/LifecycleTracking\/VersionStore","text":"VersionStore","preciseIdentifier":"s:17LifecycleTracking12VersionStoreP"},{"kind":"text","text":" = FileVersionStore(), "},{"kind":"externalParam","text":"notificationCenter"},{"kind":"text","text":": "},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","text":"NotificationCenter","preciseIdentifier":"s:20FoundationEssentials18NotificationCenterC"},{"kind":"text","text":" = .default, "},{"kind":"externalParam","text":"file"},{"kind":"text","text":": "},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","text":"String","preciseIdentifier":"s:SS"},{"kind":"text","text":" = "},{"kind":"keyword","text":"#file"},{"kind":"text","text":", "},{"kind":"externalParam","text":"fileID"},{"kind":"text","text":": "},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","text":"String","preciseIdentifier":"s:SS"},{"kind":"text","text":" = "},{"kind":"keyword","text":"#fileID"},{"kind":"text","text":", "},{"kind":"externalParam","text":"function"},{"kind":"text","text":": "},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","text":"String","preciseIdentifier":"s:SS"},{"kind":"text","text":" = "},{"kind":"keyword","text":"#function"},{"kind":"text","text":", "},{"kind":"externalParam","text":"line"},{"kind":"text","text":": "},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","text":"Int","preciseIdentifier":"s:Si"},{"kind":"text","text":" = "},{"kind":"keyword","text":"#line"},{"kind":"text","text":", "},{"kind":"externalParam","text":"column"},{"kind":"text","text":": "},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","text":"Int","preciseIdentifier":"s:Si"},{"kind":"text","text":" = "},{"kind":"keyword","text":"#column"},{"kind":"text","text":") -> "},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","identifier":"doc:\/\/LifecycleTracking\/documentation\/LifecycleTracking\/LifecycleObservation","text":"LifecycleObservation","preciseIdentifier":"s:17LifecycleTracking0A11ObservationV"}]}],"kind":"declarations"},{"parameters":[{"name":"kinds","content":[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"The kinds of event to track; every kind by default. Leaving one out doesn’t"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"stop the rest of the work: the version is still saved, and the records still made"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"durable on backgrounding."}],"type":"paragraph"}]},{"name":"version","content":[{"inlineContent":[{"text":"The version the app runs at now; the bundle’s ","type":"text"},{"code":"CFBundleShortVersionString","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"by default. ","type":"text"},{"code":"nil","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" tracks neither installs nor updates, and saves nothing.","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}]},{"name":"versionStore","content":[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Where the version is kept from one launch to the next; a"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/LifecycleTracking\/documentation\/LifecycleTracking\/FileVersionStore","type":"reference","isActive":true},{"type":"text","text":" in "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"SegmentStore.defaultDirectory"},{"type":"text","text":" by default."}],"type":"paragraph"}]},{"name":"notificationCenter","content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Where the platform posts its lifecycle notifications; the default"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"center by default."}]}]},{"name":"file","content":[{"inlineContent":[{"text":"The caller’s file; leave it to its default.","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}]},{"name":"fileID","content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"The caller’s module and file name; leave it to its default."}]}]},{"name":"function","content":[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"The caller’s enclosing declaration; leave it to its default."}],"type":"paragraph"}]},{"name":"line","content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"The caller’s line; leave it to its default.","type":"text"}]}]},{"name":"column","content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"The caller’s column; leave it to its default."}]}]}],"kind":"parameters"},{"content":[{"anchor":"return-value","text":"Return Value","level":2,"type":"heading"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"The observation, which tracks until it is cancelled, finished or released."}],"type":"paragraph"}],"kind":"content"},{"content":[{"level":2,"anchor":"discussion","type":"heading","text":"Discussion"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Nothing is tracked until this is called. Call it as the app launches, such as in its"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"application delegate’s "},{"code":"application(_:didFinishLaunchingWithOptions:)","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":", and keep what it"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"returns:"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"syntax":"swift","type":"codeListing","code":["lifecycle = tracker.trackLifecycle()"]},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"As it starts, it compares "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"version"},{"type":"text","text":" with the one "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"versionStore"},{"type":"text","text":" saved: none tracks an"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"install, another an update, the same neither; it then saves "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"version"},{"type":"text","text":". Then it tracks an"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"open, not from the background. After that, each transition tracks once, however many times"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"it is reported:"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"type":"unorderedList","items":[{"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"iOS, iPadOS, tvOS, visionOS and Mac Catalyst: "},{"code":"UIApplication","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":"’s notifications. Entering"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"the background tracks "},{"isActive":true,"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/LifecycleTracking\/documentation\/LifecycleTracking\/ApplicationBackgrounded"},{"type":"text","text":", returning to the foreground"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"isActive":true,"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/LifecycleTracking\/documentation\/LifecycleTracking\/ApplicationOpened"},{"type":"text","text":" from the background, and terminating "},{"isActive":true,"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/LifecycleTracking\/documentation\/LifecycleTracking\/ApplicationTerminated"},{"type":"text","text":"."},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"A scene-based app gets them once for the whole app, not per scene."}],"type":"paragraph"}]},{"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"watchOS: "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"WKApplication"},{"type":"text","text":"‘s, without termination, which watchOS doesn’t report."}],"type":"paragraph"}]},{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"macOS: ","type":"text"},{"code":"NSApplication","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":"’s. Another app becoming active counts as the background, this","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"one becoming active again as the foreground.","type":"text"}]}]},{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"Linux: no notifications; ","type":"text"},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/LifecycleTracking\/documentation\/LifecycleTracking\/LifecycleObservation\/finish()","isActive":true,"type":"reference"},{"text":" tracks the termination.","type":"text"}]}]}]},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Leaving the foreground, it also makes the tracker’s records durable: it waits for the"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"tracker’s worker to write every record tracked so far to the tracker’s store, then calls"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"the store’s "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"synchronize()"},{"type":"text","text":". A delivery batched with "},{"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/LifecycleTracking\/documentation\/LifecycleTracking\/LifecycleBatchStrategy","isActive":true},{"type":"text","text":" sends what"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"is pending as it reads the "},{"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/LifecycleTracking\/documentation\/LifecycleTracking\/ApplicationBackgrounded","isActive":true},{"type":"text","text":" record. A notification’s handler only"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"hands the transition on; the tracking, the version store and the store’s work run on a"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"task of their own, never on the thread that posted it. Where the system suspends an app in the"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"background (all but macOS and Mac Catalyst), the handler asks it for background time"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"("},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"ProcessInfo.performExpiringActivity"},{"type":"text","text":"), held until the records are durable. A termination’s records are made durable the same way, without"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"holding the main thread up: what the process doesn’t finish before it exits is what the"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"tracker’s documented loss window takes."}],"type":"paragraph"},{"inlineContent":[{"text":"It keeps no state outside what it returns. Two calls observe twice, so call it once per","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"tracker.","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}],"kind":"content"}],"seeAlsoSections":[{"title":"Tracking the lifecycle","generated":true,"anchor":"Tracking-the-lifecycle","identifiers":["doc:\/\/LifecycleTracking\/documentation\/LifecycleTracking\/LifecycleObservation"]}],"schemaVersion":{"major":0,"minor":3,"patch":0},"hierarchy":{"paths":[["doc:\/\/LifecycleTracking\/documentation\/LifecycleTracking","doc:\/\/LifecycleTracking\/documentation\/LifecycleTracking\/Trackers","doc:\/\/LifecycleTracking\/documentation\/LifecycleTracking\/Trackers\/Tracker"]]},"metadata":{"extendedModule":"Trackers","fragments":[{"text":"func","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"trackLifecycle","kind":"identifier"},{"text":"(","kind":"text"},{"text":"kinds","kind":"externalParam"},{"text":": ","kind":"text"},{"text":"Set","preciseIdentifier":"s:Sh","kind":"typeIdentifier"},{"text":"<","kind":"text"},{"text":"LifecycleObservation","preciseIdentifier":"s:17LifecycleTracking0A11ObservationV","kind":"typeIdentifier"},{"text":".","kind":"text"},{"text":"Kind","preciseIdentifier":"s:17LifecycleTracking0A11ObservationV4KindO","kind":"typeIdentifier"},{"text":">, ","kind":"text"},{"text":"version","kind":"externalParam"},{"text":": ","kind":"text"},{"text":"String","preciseIdentifier":"s:SS","k